# Sanar, Innovative First-Year: "At the beginning of your first main phase, reveal cards from the top of your library until you
# reveal X nonland cards, where X is the number of colors among permanents you control. For each of those colors, you may exile
# a card of that color from among the revealed cards. Then shuffle. You may cast the exiled cards this turn." Bot1's only colored
# permanent is Sanar, blue and red (hybrid {U/R}{U/R}), Black Lotus and the Mox colorless artifacts: X is 2. On turn 3 the draw
# takes the Island; the trigger reveals Lightning Bolt, Mountain and Counterspell (two nonland cards, the Mountain between them
# revealed too, a land of no color) and the Elves below them stay unrevealed. Bot1 exiles Counterspell for blue and the Bolt
# for red, the library is shuffled, and the Bolt, cast for {R}, hits Bot2. The Counterspell is still in exile once the turn is
# over, and cannot be cast on turn 5.

